==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1~16.67 seconds<sup>30f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
One Horn has insane stamina, but is extremely slow and has the shortest range of any regular enemy in the game, buying you plenty of time to [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|whale]] on him before he reaches your attackers. His short range makes [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]] surprisingly viable against him, at least early in the game.

The use of [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]], such as [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Bean Cats]], [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cat]] and Whale Cat is highly advised against One Horn. In fact, just spamming [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]], Brave Cats and UFO Cats is enough to beat him.

After the first One Horn is defeated, another will spawn when you hit the enemy base. When that happens, use the same strategy you used for the first One Horn in order to win the stage.

