==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Miyagi Prefecture'''.
*Miyagi Prefecture's base is a [https://flickr.com/photos/jpellgen/4191794210 Date Masamune statue] that can be seen near the ruins of [[wikipedia:Aoba Castle|Aoba Castle]] in Sendai, a city in Miyagi founded by Date Masamune.
*Miyagi Prefecture's [[Treasure]] being a Tongue is a reference to [[wikipedia:Gyūtan|gyūtan]], a beef tongue dish originating in Sendai, Miyagi.

